Douglas W. Oldenburg, Lindsey J. Heagy, Seogi Kang and Rowan Cockett. 3D electromagnetic modelling and inversion: A case for open-source. [Author preprint, arXiv:1902.08245v1, 21 February 2019](https://arxiv.org/abs/1902.08245v1) · [Full preprint](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1902.08245). Journal version: Exploration Geophysics 51(1), 25–37, 2020; DOI 10.1080/08123985.2019.1580118.

Read the complete paper and reconstruct one of its airborne/ground electromagnetic modelling or joint-inversion cases with the linked notebooks and the actual software version. Examine experiment geometry, model assumptions, regularization, identifiability and alternative explanations.

The primary preprint record, authors, version, journal citation and linked reproducibility materials were checked on 29 October 2026. A repository link is not proof that an old environment still runs. Software, preprint, journal version and data have distinct notices. No solver, notebooks, earth data or article is copied here.

